a composition at the root: text "root: 2" held=1
wide, and its extra counted: text "s wide 1" | text "s extra: 1" held=2
narrow: the extra left: text "s narrow 2" held=1
wide again: a new extra: text "s wide 3" | text "s extra: 0" held=2
seeded at 5, pressed: text "c: 6" held=1
another key: text "c: 5" held=1
the first key again: text "c: 5" held=1
one key twice: text "a: 0" | text "b: 1" held=2
warnings: `counter` keeps state, and here its instances are told apart by their order alone — they share a key, or one site made them and none wears one: give each its own `key`
